# 80 -- Attitude / rate tuning
#
# These are AUTOTUNE RESULTS (not defaults), from the 2026-06-13..16 flights; see
# the "Tuning" log in ardupilot.md for the per-axis before/after. A QuickTune pass
# preceded autotune. AUTOTUNE_AXES was cleared afterward so the mode is unbound.
#   provenance: d024d6a (roll), efc0901 (pitch), 2f39366 (yaw), aec02c2 (retune)
#
# Angle-P is well above the 4.5 floor on all axes (quality tracks ANG_P). Pitch
#   gains < roll, attributed to fore/aft weight imbalance (persistent ~22% fore/aft
#   RPM split, #169).  [ardupilot.md tuning notes; #169]
#
